text:
I used the patch command to draw out the UFO.  Then I animated it by updating the XData and YData with my calculated values.  Here's a quick example of moving a square up on the graph:

H = patch([-1 1 1 -1], [-1 -1 1 1], 'b');
axis([-3 3 -3 3]);
for i = 1:10
    pause(0.2);
    H.YData = [-1 -1 1 1] + i/10;
end
